5%§r, making it better than the §3Stirling Engine§r. However, it still has a throughput limit as it can only hold up to 2000 mB of steam. Its maximum processing rate is 2000 mB/t, producing a considerable §e3400 HE/t§r or §e68 kHE/s§r. It is therefore the best generator available before §3Steam Turbines§r.\n\nA boiler being heated up by a heating oven using coal will produce §e17kHE/s§r.",\n          "globalShare:1": 0,\n          "icon:10": {\n            "Count:3": 1,\n            "Damage:2": 0,\n            "OreDict:8": "",\n            "id:8": "hbm:tile.machine_steam_engine"\n          },\n          "isMain:1": 1,\n          "isSilent:1": 0,\n          "lockedProgress:1": 0,\n          "name:8": "Steam Engine",\n          "notification_duration:5": -1.0,\n          "notification_effect:3": -1,\n          "notification_fade_in:5": -1.0,\n          "notification_fade_out:5": -1.0,\n          "notification_icon_offset_y:3": -2147483648,\n          "notification_icon_scale:5": -1.0,\n          "notification_pos_x:3": -2147483648,\n          "notification_pos_y:3": -2147483648,\n          "notification_show_icon:8": "default",\n          "notification_style:8": "default",\n          "notification_subtitle:8": "",\n          "notification_subtitle_scale:5": -1.0,\n          "notification_title:8": "",\n          "notification_title_scale:5": -1.0,\n          "particle_count:3": -1,\n          "questLogic:8": "OR",\n          "repeatTime:3": -1,\n          "repeat_relative:1": 1,\n          "simultaneous:1": 0,\n          "snd_complete:8": "random.levelup",\n          "snd_update:8": "random.levelup",\n          "taskLogic:8": "AND",\n          "visibility:8": "NORMAL"\n        }\n      },\n      "questIDHigh:4": -3069375608230492990,\n      "questIDLow:4": -6865874965143909140,\n      "rewards:9": {},\n      "tasks:9": {\n        "0:10": {\n          "autoConsume:1": 0,\n          "consume:1": 0,\n          "groupDetect:1": 0,\n          "ignoreNBT:1": 1,\n          "index:3": 0,\n          "partialMatch:1": 1,\n          "requireOnlyOneItem:1": 0,\n          "requiredItems:9": {\n            "0:10": {\n              "Count:3": 1,\n              "Damage:2": 0,\n              "OreDict:8": "",\n              "id:8": "hbm:tile.machine_steam_engine"\n            }\n          },\n          "taskID:8": "bq_standard:retrieval"\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "10:10": {\n      "preRequisites:9": {\n        "0:10": {\n          "questIDHigh:4": -1809908221839128987,\n          "questIDLow:4": -6525338611614709347\n        },\n        "1:10": {\n          "questIDHigh:4": -1206229632949400496,\n          "questIDLow:4": -8132060648773646286\n        }\n      },\n      "properties:10": {\n        "betterquesting:10": {\n          "autoClaim:1": 0,\n          "completion_animation:8": "default",\n          "completion_particle:8": "default",\n          "confetti_icon:10": {\n            "Count:3": 0,\n            "Damage:2": 0,\n            "OreDict:8": "",\n            "id:8": "minecraft:stick"\n          },\n          "countAsQuest:1": 1,\n          "desc:8": "The §6Internet Card§r grants computers access to the internet. It provides ways to perform simple HTTP requests, as well as to open plain TCP client sockets that can be read and written to.\n\nInstalling an internet card in a computer will also attach a custom file system that contains a few internet related applications, such as one for downloading and uploading snippets from/to pastebin as well as a \"wget\" clone that allows downloading data from arbitrary HTTP URLs.",\n          "globalShare:1": 0,\n          "icon:10": {\n            "Count:3": 1,\n            "Damage:2": 44,\n            "OreDict:8": "",\n            "id:8": "OpenComputers:item"\n          },\n          "isMain:1": 0,\n          "isSilent:1": 0,\n          "lockedProgress:1": 0,\n          "name:8": "Internet Card",\n          "notification_duration:5": -1.0,\n          "notification_effect:3": -1,\n          "notification_fade_in:5": -1.0,\n          "notification_fade_out:5": -1.0,\n          "notification_icon_offset_y:3": -2147483648,\n          "notification_icon_scale:5": -1.0,\n          "notification_pos_x:3": -2147483648,\n          "notification_pos_y:3": -2147483648,\n          "notification_show_icon:8": "default",\n          "notification_style:8": "default",\n          "notification_subtitle:8": "",\n          "notification_subtitle_scale:5": -1.0,\n          "notification_title:8": "",\n          "notification_title_scale:5": -1.0,\n          "particle_count:3": -1,\n          "questLogic:8": "AND",\n          "repeatTime:3": -1,\n          "repeat_relative:1": 1,\n          "simultaneous:1": 0,\n          "snd_complete:8": "random.levelup",\n          "snd_update:8": "random.levelup",\n          "taskLogic:8": "AND",\n          "visibility:8": "NORMAL"\n        }\n      },\n      "questIDHigh:4": -3049837447604715338,\n      "questIDLow:4": -8276284789645043977,\n      "rewards:9": {},\n      "tasks:9": {\n        "0:10": {\n          "autoConsume:1": 0,\n          "consume:1": 0,\n          "groupDetect:1": 0,\n          "ignoreNBT:1": 1,\n          "index:3": 0,\n          "partialMatch:1": 1,\n          "requireOnlyOneItem:1": 0,\n          "requiredItems:9": {\n            "0:10": {\n              "Count:3": 1,\n              "Damage:2": 44,\n              "OreDict:8": "",\n              "id:8": "OpenComputers:item"\n            }\n          },\n          "taskID:8": "bq_standard:retrieval"\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "11:10": {\n      "preRequisites:9": {\n        "0:10": {\n          "questIDHigh:4": 2454242965352891519,\n          "questIDLow:4": -6069586783761234700\n        }\n      },\n      "properties:10": {\n        "betterquesting:10": {\n          "autoClaim:1": 0,\n          "completion_animation:8": "default",\n          "completion_particle:8": "default",\n          "confetti_icon:10": {\n            "Count:3": 0,\n            "Damage:2": 0,\n            "OreDict:8": "",\n            "id:8": "minecraft:stick"\n          },\n          "countAsQuest:1": 1,\n          "desc:8": "§3P2P ME§r can be used to transport massive amounts of channels without laying many cables.\n\n§2This quest serves as a guide on how to effectively use P2P ME.§r\n\nOnce an §3Energy Acceptor§r has been set up, it is highly recommended (and likely needed) that an §3Energy Cell§r is placed next to it as to ensure that there is enough power going to the system, as more components increase the energy demands of the ME system.\n\nAfter that, 2 §3ME Controllers§r are required, one to provide the channels that machines will use, and another to transport the other\u0027s channels by the P2P connections. The top controller can be made bigger by attaching more controllers next to it.\n\n[img height=1000]betterquesting:textures/QB_Controller1.png[/img]\n\nAfter the controllers are placed, on the top controller, a P2P Tunnel - ME needs to be placed on any side. The §9Blue Cable§r will serve as the cable that connects the P2P connections, and as such, it needs to be connected to the bottom controller.\n\n[img height=1000]betterquesting:textures/QB_Controller2.png[/img]\n\nBy linking the P2P connections together using a §6Memory Card§r, the 32 channels from one side of the top controller will only use 1 channel from the bottom controller to be transported to any destination. The §cRed Cable§r now has access to 32 channels.\n\n[img height=1000]betterquesting:textures/QB_Controller3.png[/img]\n\n[img height=1000]betterquesting:textures/QB_Controller4.png[/img]\n\nBy expanding on the previous example, more connections can be added to fully utilize all channels.\n\n[img height=1000]betterquesting:textures/QB_Controller5.png[/img]\n\n[img height=1000]betterquesting:textures/QB_controller6.png[/img]\n",\n          "globalShare:1": 0,\n          "icon:10": {\n            "Count:3": 1,\n            "Damage:2": 2,\n            "OreDict:8": "",\n            "id:8": "chisel:futura"\n          },\n          "isMain:1": 1,\n          "isSilent:1": 0,\n          "lockedProgress:1": 0,\n          "name:8": "P2P ME Networking",\n          "notification_duration:5": -1.0,\n          "notification_effect:3": -1,\n          "notification_fade_in:5": -1.0,\n          "notification_fade_out:5": -1.0,\n          "notification_icon_offset_y:3": -2147483648,\n          "notification_icon_scale:5": -1.0,\n          "notification_pos_x:3": -2147483648,\n          "notification_pos_y:3": -2147483648,\n          "notification_show_icon:8": "default",\n          "notification_style:8": "default",\n          "notification_subtitle:8": "",\n          "notification_subtitle_scale:5": -1.0,\n          "notification_title:8": "",\n          "notification_title_scale:5": -1.0,\n          "particle_count:3": -1,\n          "questLogic:8": "AND",\n          "repeatTime:3": -1,\n          "repeat_relative:1": 1,\n          "simultaneous:1": 0,\n          "snd_complete:8": "random.levelup",\n          "snd_update:8": "random.levelup",\n          "taskLogic:8": "AND",\n          "visibility:8": "NORMAL"\n        }\n      },\n      "questIDHigh:4": -3048538136168087485,\n      "questIDLow:4": -5750375353169774642,\n      "rewards:9": {},\n      "tasks:9": {\n        "0:10": {\n          "index:3": 0,\n          "taskID:8": "bq_standard:checkbox"\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "12:10": {\n      "preRequisites:9": {\n        "0:10": {\n          "questIDHigh:4": 3010639817883009679,\n          "questIDLow:4": -6739056000943019550\n        },\n        "1:10": {\n          "questIDHigh:4": 6432556703531286608,\n          "questIDLow:4": -6219066342093590357\n        }\n      },\n      "properties:10": {\n        "betterquesting:10": {\n          "autoClaim:1": 0,\n          "completion_animation:8": "default",\n          "completion_particle:8": "default",\n          "confetti_icon:10": {\n            "Count:3": 0,\n            "Damage:2": 0,\n            "OreDict:8": "",\n            "id:8": "minecraft:stick"\n          },\n          "countAsQuest:1": 1,\n          "desc:8": "Parallelisation of processes can significantly cut down on waiting time and as such it is highly recommended that P2P Interfaces are used.\n\n§2This quest serves as a guide on how to use P2P Interfaces.§r\n\nAs any P2P Connection goes, there needs to be one input, which in this case, holds the §6ME Patterns§r.\n\n[img height=1000]betterquesting:textures/QB_P2P_Interface1.png[/img]\n\nAfter patterns are inserted in the first P2P interface, place down the rest of the output interfaces you want and link them together using a §6Memory Card§r.\n\nIn the image below, the P2P interface highlighted in green stores the patterns, while the ones in blue, are the output ones which will connect machines to the ME system.\n\n[img height=1000]betterquesting:textures/QB_P2P_Interface2.png[/img]\n\nMake sure to have blocking mode enabled on all output P2P interfaces as to prevent clogging and having multiple recipes trying to be executed at once in the same machine.\n\n[img height=1000]betterquesting:textures/QB_P2P_Interface3.png[/img]\n\nFinally, place your desired machines at the output P2P interfaces and add a way of retrieving the items once the operation is done, in this case import buses.\n\n[img height=1000]betterquesting:textures/QB_P2P_Interface4.png[/img]\n",\n          "globalShare:1": 0,\n          "icon:10": {\n            "Count:3": 1,\n            "Damage:2": 0,\n            "OreDict:8": "",\n            "id:8": "neenergistics:tile.pattern_interface"\n          },\n          "isMain:1": 1,\n          "isSilent:1": 0,\n          "lockedProgress:1": 0,\n          "name:8": "P2P Interface Parallelisation",\n          "notification_duration:5": -1.0,\n          "notification_effect:3": -1,\n          "notification_fade_in:5": -1.0,\n          "notification_fade_out:5": -1.0,\n          "notification_icon_offset_y:3": -2147483648,\