own into smaller pieces, each with different products that can be obtained from them. \n§a§bOre Slop§r, which is created when the machine is operating, can be processed into many useful products, especially when it is sent through an §3Electrolysis Machine§r.\n\nThe §6Bedrock Ore Desity Scanner§r shows information on the composition of Bedrock Ore deposits.\n\nBedrock ore processing can be both an energy and resourse expensive operation so it is recommended that it is explored after having good infrastructure.\n\n§2Consider adding a Power Saving Upgrade to the drill as it only reduces power without affecting the mining speed. Additionally, installing an Effectiveness Upgrade on the ore slopper will make it give out more resourses.§r§r",\n          "globalShare:1": 0,\n          "icon:10": {\n            "Count:3": 1,\n            "Damage:2": 0,\n            "OreDict:8": "",\n            "id:8": "hbm:tile.machine_ore_slopper"\n          },\n          "isMain:1": 1,\n          "isSilent:1": 0,\n          "lockedProgress:1": 0,\n          "name:8": "Bedrock Ore Processing",\n          "notification_duration:5": -1.0,\n          "notification_effect:3": -1,\n          "notification_fade_in:5": -1.0,\n          "notification_fade_out:5": -1.0,\n          "notification_icon_offset_y:3": -2147483648,\n          "notification_icon_scale:5": -1.0,\n          "notification_pos_x:3": -2147483648,\n          "notification_pos_y:3": -2147483648,\n          "notification_show_icon:8": "default",\n          "notification_style:8": "default",\n          "notification_subtitle:8": "",\n          "notification_subtitle_scale:5": -1.0,\n          "notification_title:8": "",\n          "notification_title_scale:5": -1.0,\n          "particle_count:3": -1,\n          "questLogic:8": "AND",\n          "repeatTime:3": -1,\n          "repeat_relative:1": 1,\n          "simultaneous:1": 0,\n          "snd_complete:8": "random.levelup",\n          "snd_update:8": "random.levelup",\n         