 mycelium will slowly convert into a mycelium block, no Silk Touch needed.\n\nA wooden barrel filled with §bWater§r placed next to cobblestone will slowly convert it into mossy cobblestone, costing §e100 mB§r per block. The surrounding blocks must be unaffected by rain. Placing a barrel on mycelium converts its water into §5Witch Water§r, though the barrel itself may disappear in the process. Water flowing above a barrel filled with lava transforms into obsidian.\n\nStone barrels can spawn creatures when tapped with a doll: a barrel of lava with an Angry Doll summons a Blaze, and a barrel of §5Witch Water§r with a Creepy Doll summons an Enderman.\n\nBarrels can convert items using fluids: §5Witch Water§r turns sand into soul sand, lava turns redstone into netherrack or glowstone dust into end stone, and §bWater§r can turn dust into clay, milk into slime balls, or mushroom stew into §5Witch Water§r.\n\n§2Hoppers can be used to insert and eject items from barrels, making composting easy to automate.§r",\n          "globalShare:1": 0,\n          "icon:10": {\n            "Count:3": 1,\n            "Damage:2": 0,\n            "OreDict:8": "",\n            "id:8": "exnihilo:barrel"\n          },\n          "isMain:1": 0,\n          "isSilent:1": 0,\n          "lockedProgress:1": 0,\n          "name:8": "Do a Barrel!",\n          "notification_duration:5": -1.0,\n          "notification_effect:3": -1,\n          "notification_fade_in:5": -1.0,\n          "notification_fade_out:5": -1.0,\n          "notification_icon_offset_y:3": -2147483648,\n          "notification_icon_scale:5": -1.0,\n          "notification_pos_x:3": -2147483648,\n          "notification_pos_y:3": -2147483648,\n          "notification_show_icon:8": "default",\n          "notification_style:8": "default",\n          "notification_subtitle:8": "",\n          "notification_subtitle_scale:5": -1.0,\n          "notification_title:8": "",\n          "notification_title_scale:5": -1.0,\n          "particle_c