.\n\n[img height=1000]betterquesting:textures/BQ_NET1.png[/img]\n\nFor the purposes of this quest, the main network will store dirt blocks, while the subnet will store copper blocks.\n\n[img height=1000]betterquesting:textures/BQ_NET2.png[/img]\n\n[img height=1000]betterquesting:textures/BQ_NET3.png[/img]\n\nTo make the contents of the subnet, the copper blocks, visible to the main net, one must make an §3Interface§r-§3Storage Bus§r§r combo. The storage bus must be on the side of the main network.\n\n[img height=1000]betterquesting:textures/BQ_NET4.png[/img]\n\nMake sure to filter the main network storage bus, and to also make it \"Extract Only\".\n\n[img height=1000]betterquesting:textures/BQ_NET5.png[/img]\n\nNow the main network has access to materials stored on the sub network, which can be used for crafting.\n\n[img height=1000]betterquesting:textures/BQ_NET6.png[/img]",\n          "globalShare:1": 0,\n          "icon:10": {\n            "Count:3": 1,\n            "Damage:2": 440,\n            "OreDict:8": "",\n            "id:8": "appliedenergistics2:item.ItemMultiPart"\n          },\n          "isMain:1": 0,\n          "isSilent:1": 0,\n          "lockedProgress:1": 0,\n          "name:8": "ME subnetting",\n          "notification_duration:5": -1.0,\n          "notification_effect:3": -1,\n          "notification_fade_in:5": -1.0,\n          "notification_fade_out:5": -1.0,\n          "notification_icon_offset_y:3": -2147483648,\n          "notification_icon_scale:5": -1.0,\n          "notification_pos_x:3": -2147483648,\n          "notification_pos_y:3": -2147483648,\n          "notification_show_icon:8": "default",\n          "notification_style:8": "default",\n          "notification_subtitle:8": "",\n          "notification_subtitle_scale:5": -1.0,\n          "notification_title:8": "",\n          "notification_title_scale:5": -1.0,\n          "particle_count:3": -1,\n          "questLogic:8": "AND",\n          "repeatTime:3": -1,\n          "repeat_relat